  "notes": "Single-cell characterization data for NCA Samsung INR21700-50E and NMC LG-Chem INR21700-M50T cells, and parallel-connected module experiments. The README warns modules are not single cells. Two cell models are used in the modules (Samsung INR21700-50E, NCA, and LG-Chem INR21700-M50T, NMC), per the landing page. Both are ~5 Ah-class 21700 cells with matching 2.5-4.2V limits; recorded values are for the Samsung cell specifically (official datasheet), with LG M50T's nearly identical spec (18.2Wh/3.63V nominal = ~5.0Ah, 2.5-4.2V, dia<=21.10mm x height<=70.15mm, from LG's INR21700 M50 18.2Wh spec, the closest available document to the exact M50T tab variant) noted here rather than forced into these singular fields."
